 py-3 sm:px-8 sm:py-4\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 hover:no-underline\" href=\"/\"><div class=\"flex h-9 w-9 sm:h-10 sm:w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-plum text-gold font-serif text-xl font-bold shadow-md\">M</div><div class=\"leading-none\"><span class=\"block font-serif text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-plum\">Moremi</span><span class=\"mt-0.5 block font-sans text-[0.55rem] sm:text-[0.6rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-plum/60\">Foundation</span></div></a><div class=\"hidden sm:flex items-center gap-3 text-sm font-bold\"><a class=\"hover:text-plum text-stone-500 hover:no-underline transition-colors\" href=\"/program/\">M90</a><a class=\"hover:text-plum text-stone-500 hover:no-underline transition-colors\" href=\"/faq/\">FAQs</a><a class=\"rounded-full bg-plum/5 px-4 py-2 text-plum hover:bg-plum/10 hover:no-underline transition-colors border border-plum/10 shadow-sm sm:px-5 sm:py-2.5\" href=\"/activate/\">Log In</a></div></nav></header><main id=\"main\" class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"space-y-12 pb-12\"><section class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-[2.5rem] bg-plum px-6 py-16 text-white shadow-2xl sm:px-12 sm:py-24 lg:px-20\"><div class=\"absolute -top-24 -right-24 h-96 w-96 rounded-full bg-plum-light blur-[100px] opacity-60 mix-blend-screen\"></div><div class=\"absolute -bottom-24 -left-24 h-96 w-96 rounded-full bg-gold blur-[120px] opacity-20 mix-blend-screen\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 grid lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-12 items-center\"><div class=\"space-y-8\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-white/10 px-4 py-2 backdrop-blur-md\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles lucide-stars text-gold\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z\"></path><path d=\"M20 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 4h-4\"></path><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"20\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold tracking-widest text-gold uppercase\">Lagos Founding Cohort / Ages 18–35</p></div><h1 class=\"text-white text-balance\">Your ambition deserves the right circle.</h1><p class=\"max-w-lg text-lg sm:text-xl font-medium text-white/80 leading-relaxed\">Meet people who take your ideas seriously. Spend 90 days learning from mentors and building something your community can use.</p><a class=\"group inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-full bg-gold px-8 py-4 text-lg font-bold text-plum shadow-[0_0_40px_rgb(233,201,133,0.3)] transition-all hover:scale-105 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-[0_0_50px_rgb(255,255,255,0.4)] active:scale-95\" href=\"/program/\">Explore M90<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:-translate-y-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></div><figure class=\"mt-12 lg:mt-0\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/5] sm:aspect-video lg:aspect-square overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border border-white/10 bg-black/40 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-sm\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-8 text-center\"><div class=\"h-20 w-20 rounded-full bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/20\"><span class=\"font-serif text-4xl text-gold\">M</span></div><h2 class=\"font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-white\">Opening doors.<br/><span class=\"text-gold italic\">Raising leaders.</span></h2></div></div><figcaption class=\"mt-4 text-center text-sm font-medium text-white/50\">Convener’s welcome film · coming soon</figcaption></figure></div></section><div class=\"space-y-6\"><div class=\"text-center sm:text-left\"><h2>How the 90 days work</h2></div><div class=\"grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3\"><article class=\"panel relative overflow-hidden group\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 p-6 opacity-5 group-hover:opacity-10 transition-opacity\"><span class=\"font-serif text-8xl font-bold text-plum\">1</span></div><p class=\"eyebrow\">Days 1–30</p><h3 class=\"text-3xl text-plum\">Belong</h3><p class=\"text-stone-600 font-medium leading-relaxed relative z-10\">Find your circle, meet a mentor and name one goal you can act on.</p></article><article class=\"panel relative overflow-hidden group\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 p-6 opacity-5 group-hover:opacity-10 transition-opacity\"><span class=\"font-serif text-8xl font-bold text-plum\">2</span></div><p class=\"eyebrow\">Days 31–60</p><h3 class=\"text-3xl text-plum\">Become</h3><p class=\"text-stone-600 font-medium leading-relaxed relative z-10\">Bring a real challenge to seminars and founder conversations. Try one idea in your own work.</p></article><article class=\"panel relative overflow-hidden group\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 p-6 opacity-5 group-hover:opacity-10 transition-opacity\"><span class=\"font-serif text-8xl font-bold text-plum\">3</span></div><p class=\"eyebrow\">Days 61–90</p><h3 class=\"text-3xl text-plum\">Build</h3><p class=\"text-stone-600 font-medium leading-relaxed relative z-10\">Put your learning to work on a small project that helps someone in your community.</p></article></div></div><section class=\"panel\"><h2>Hear about the Lagos intake</h2><form class=\"stack\"><fieldset class=\"stack\"><label>Your name<input type=\"text\" required=\"\" maxLength=\"120\" name=\"name\"/></label><label>Email<input type=\"email\" required=\"\" maxLength=\"254\" name=\"email\"/></label><small class=\"text-stone-500 font-medium\">MCF may contact you about this intake.</small><button class=\"button\">Register my interest</button></fieldset></form></section></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"mt-auto border-t border-stone-200 bg-white py-12 text-center text-sm font-medium text-stone-500\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-plum/5 text-plum font-serif font-bold mb-4\">M</div><p>© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> Moremi Community Foundation.</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-stone-400\">Built for the Lagos Founding Cohort.</p></footer><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-2b4d7c5d580743fd.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:\\\"static/chunks/500-fc3b64d9ff4a32a7.js\\\"\\n3:\\\"static/chunks/app/page-bcab4fcc3741afac.js\\\"\\n4:I[8500,[\\\"500\\\",\\\"$2\\\",\\\"974\\\",\\\"$3\\\"],\\\"\\\"]\\n5:I[7121,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n6:I[4581,[],\\\"\\\"]\\nc:\\\"ViewportBoundary\\\"\\nd:I[484,[],\\\"$c\\\"]\\nf:\\\"MetadataBoundary\\\"\\n10:I[484,[],\\\"$f\\\"]\\n11:\\\"$Sreact.suspense\\\"\\n13:I[7123,[],\\\"default\\\",1]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/css/4a94dd0c659d2f0e.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n7:[[\\\"children\\\",{\\\"s\\\":\\\"__PAGE__\\\",\\\"h\\\":512,\\\"d\\\":{\\\"r\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"c\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"space-y-12 pb-12\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-[2.5rem] bg-plum px-6 py-16 text-white shadow-2xl sm:px-12 sm:py-24 lg:px-20\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"absolute -top-24 -right-24 h-96 w-96 rounded-full bg-plum-light blur-[100px] opacity-60 mix-blend-screen\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"absolute -bottom-24 -left-24 h-96 w-96 rounded-full bg-gold blur-[120px] opacity-20